	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "n148RuYflWNlAAZyS",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 19, DX 13, IQ 4, HT 12, HP 19, WILL 8, PER 9, FP 12, SPEED 6.25, MOVE 9, DODGE 9, DR 0. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "nRF_Ga_KYPcQSXnSK",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 30 (offense 18, protection 12), threat tier standard, appearing 4."
		},
		{
			"id": "nkSwaR5ijA4yGI7n_",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/lion.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "nUk9kluZ-JInPPZPv",
			"text": "Independent build total: 7 points of racial traits plus 16 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "n0ZoD1jTrkIfQwi_x",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Lion (SRD 5.1); Lion (SRD 3.5). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "nud9aRjwjz91M6c6j",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "nmvQG939_KEOH7nHF",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 6, 9 at a sprint (primary). The published Move folds this creature's Enhanced Move into a single figure."
		},
		{
			"id": "nzcPKKR2DApNKYKsZ",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
